OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWindy and
OL,6,Fcloudy. Rain soon extending from the
OL,7,Fwest across the whole area during the
OL,8,Fevening, perhaps turning heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes and to snow over west hills.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FCloud, rain, hill snow
OL,12,Finitially, erratically clearing as
OL,13,Fsunshine and showers follow from the
OL,14,Fnorthwest through the day, with these
OL,15,Flater outbreaks focused over the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
