OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FShowers occasionally reaching northern
OL,7,Fareas. Central Belt possibly seeing a
OL,8,Fband of rain and hill snow reaching
OL,9,Ffrom the south Tuesday. Otherwise
OL,10,Ffrosty starts, then dry with sunny
OL,11,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
